WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.325
An if lets your program choose which lines to run.

2
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:07.775
The if asks a question: is i less than three?

3
00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:13.226
If yes, the lines under if run. If not, the lines under else run.

4
00:00:17.018 --> 00:00:20.768
The first three sides are red, and the last three are blue.
